          "_name": "header13",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header13\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image Width\" min=\"1\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"8\" condition=\"showImage\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Image\" name=\"showImage\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/grey20lines20on20white20background-736x1308.jpg\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"align-center\" mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText || showButtons\">\n      <div class=\"col-md-12 mb-5 content-head\">\n        <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>About us</b></h1>\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Welcome to&nbsp;<b>Lex&amp;Partners</b>, a full-service law firm based in <b>Kuala Lumpur</b>.We are dedicated to delivering clear, practical, and result-driven legal solutions to individuals,corporations, and institutions.<br><br><b>Our experienced </b>team of lawyers combines legal expertise with business insight to help clients navigate challenges, protect their rights, and achieve their goals.<br><br>Whether you are an entrepreneur starting a new venture, a company managing compliance, or anindividual seeking justice — <b><i>we stand by you, every step of the way.</i></b><br><br>Founded in <b>2002</b>, Lex &amp; Partners Law Firm has built a strong reputation for trust, transparency, andoutstanding legal service.Over the past two decades, we have represented clients across <b>Malaysia</b> and <b>internationally,</b> offering solutions that balance legal precision with practical results.<br><br><b>Our approach</b> is simple:<br><br><i><b>We listen carefully, analyze deeply, and act decisively.</b></i><br>With a diverse team of legal professionals, we specialize in both corporate and personal legal matters— ensuring that each case receives personalized attention and care.<br><br><b>Our Mission</b><br>To provide professional, ethical, and effective legal services that uphold justice and serve the<br>bestinterests of our clients.<br><br><b>Our Vision</b><br>To be a trusted law firm recognized for integrity, innovation, and excellence in legal practice.<br></p>\n        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-info-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Our Core Value</a></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n        <img src=\"../_images/hightlights/6.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
